     "description": "When it last authenticated a connection (Unix time, ms).",
     "type": "integer"
    }
   }
  },
  "SyncProgress": {
   "description": "One line of `devbox sync --json` (NDJSON). `start` carries `total`; `begin` carries `name`; `repo` carries `name`, `status` and `detail`; `done` ends the run.",
